## Interface: 16000, 16001, 11507, 11508, 11509, 11510, 40400, 40401, 40402, 40403, 50500, 50501, 50502, 120100, 120101, 120102, 120103, 120104, 120105
## Title: Claude Context
## Notes: Writes your character, location and quest log to disk so the Claude overlay app can use it as context. No network access, no automation -- just a SavedVariables dump.
## Author: You
## Version: 1.2.0
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: ClaudeContextDB

# The list above covers WoW Forever, Classic Era, Cataclysm Classic, Mists
# of Pandaria Classic and Retail as of when this was written -- it WILL
# drift as each gets patched, same as any other addon. The old guessed
# Retail range (110000-110207) turned out to be wrong -- confirmed directly
# that a real Retail client is actually on 120100 (via
# /run print(select(4, GetBuildInfo())), not a guess -- showed up as
# "Incompatible" in the AddOns list until this was corrected. A few nearby
# numbers are padded in above for near-term point patches, but there's no
# reliable way to predict Blizzard's future numbering beyond that. If this
# addon shows greyed-out/"Incompatible" in the AddOns list after a patch:
# check "Load out of date AddOns" there as an immediate workaround, and get
# the exact number via that same /run command (or the AddOns list itself,
# which shows it) and add it here.

ClaudeContext.lua
